{"articleNo":"350370","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=350370&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] 교원 원문복사 및 상호대차서비스 비용지원 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.03.04","hit":"7684","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmwehBmCCMASAHAWgLwO4IHYDkBCArgOIDquAkgGIUCWA0mgHQBWSA5kA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 24pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">교원 원문복사 및 상호대차서비스 비용지원 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:16.0pt;\">지원대상</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">재직중인 전임교원</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:16.0pt;\">지원기간</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- 2022. 3. 2.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) ~ </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">당해 예산 소진 시까지</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:16.0pt;\">지원내용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">원문복사 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">우리도서관에 소장되지 않는 학술논문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(Article),&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">학위논문</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">단행본의 부분 복사</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">상호대차 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">우리도서관 미소장 자료 중 국내 협력기관의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">관외대출이 가능한 단행본 자료</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:16.0pt;\">신청방법</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- RISS(<a href=\"http://www.riss.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">http://www.riss.kr/</a>),&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- scienceON(<a href=\"https://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://scienceon.kisti.re.kr/</a>)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">소속기관</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">금오공과대학교</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">이용자로 회원가입</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">     </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">원하는 자료를 검색 후 신청 및 도서관 서비스 담당자</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">(7168)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;letter-spacing:-0.1pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">에게 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">신청 요청</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:16.0pt;\">지원비용</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">원문복사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-size:13.0pt;\">협력기관 원문복사 의뢰 시 발생하는 이용료</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">상호대차</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 13pt;\">협력기관 자료 대출 요청시 발생하는 이용료</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
